{"title": "Absolute's Aegis", "pageid": 28301, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Absolute's_Aegis", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Aegis_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Aegis of the Absolute\">Aegis of the Absolute</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Absolute's Aegis</b> is a passive feature that reduces damage if you are branded.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If the wielder bears the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Brand\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute's Brand\">Absolute's Brand</a>, all damage received from spells is reduced by 1. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Protector\" title=\"Absolute's Protector\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Safeguard_Shield_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute%27s_Protector\" title=\"Absolute's Protector\">Absolute's Protector</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Z%27rell\" title=\"Z'rell\">Z'rell</a></li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202119\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 902/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7188/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1539/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 133/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 688976/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.521      1 -total\n 97.62%   33.701      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 51.99%   17.949      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 45.68%   15.770      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 42.85%   14.792      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 22.47%    7.758      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.08%    3.824      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.51%    3.628      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 10.23%    3.531      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.52%    3.286      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28301-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202119 and revision id 356012. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}